A: Myself, for myself, my own: how does Russian say them? It's May, and Masha is back (@draw o_may@) from the shops in Petersburg.
    draw o_masha o_tom o_bags

    erase o_bags o_may o_masha o_tom

A: Послу́шайте. Who are the presents for?
    draw ear

    ask "Who did she buy presents for?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Я купи́ла пода́рки ма́ме и бра́ту.","gloss":"I bought presents for Mum and my brother."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"А себе́?","gloss":"And for yourself?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"И себе́! Ку́ртку. Я сама́ её вы́брала.","gloss":"Me too! A jacket. I chose it myself."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Расскажи́!","gloss":"Tell me!"}] options ["her mum and her brother","Tom and his neighbour","only herself"] correct 1 reveal.text "ма́ме и бра́ту" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: Ма́ме и бра́ту: for her mum and her brother.
        wrong: Listen for ма́ме и бра́ту: her mum and her brother.

    erase reveal_1_stamp

    ask "And what did she buy for herself?" listen same options ["a jacket","a dress","a book"] correct 1 reveal.text "И себе́! Ку́ртку." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: Ку́ртку: a jacket. И себе́: and for herself too.
        wrong: Ку́ртку, a jacket: и себе́, for herself too.

    erase ear

B: Я купи́ла пода́рки ма́ме и бра́ту.
    draw n1

A: А себе́? (@highlight n2 part себе color #b0476b effect underline@) И себе́! Себе́ is the same to-ending, on a new word: себя́, oneself. It's pink today.
    draw n2

B: Я сама́ её вы́брала.
    draw n3

A: Сама́ is something else: I chose it myself, with nobody's help.
    highlight n3 part сама́ color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase n1 n2 n3

A: Себя́ first: one word for everybody, pointing back to whoever does it.
    draw tab

A: Кого́? Себя́. Я ви́жу себя́ в зе́ркале.
    draw tab_r1

A: Кому́? Себе́. Ма́ша купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку.
    draw tab_r2

A: С кем? С собо́й. Взять с собо́й: to take along, literally with oneself.
    draw tab_r3

A: О ком? О себе́. Расскажи́ о себе́! Tell me about yourself.
    draw tab_r4

A: There's no form for кто: себя́ is (@highlight tab_c2 color #b0476b@) never the one doing it, only the one it comes back to.
    draw no_who

    erase no_who

A: And the ся you know from lesson sixty-one is a short себя́: одева́юсь, (@highlight sya part сь$ color #b0476b effect underline@) I dress myself.
    draw sya

    erase tab sya

A: Сам is different: not to yourself, but by yourself, with no help.
    draw s_tom s_masha s_both

A: Я сам.
    draw s_sam

B: Я сама́.
    draw s_sama

A: Мы са́ми. Сам, сама́, са́ми: it agrees with the person, like a short adjective.
    draw s_sami

    erase s_tom s_masha s_both s_sam s_sama s_sami

A: Она́ купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку.
    draw c1

A: Себе́: for herself.
    draw c1g

A: Она́ сама́ вы́брала ку́ртку.
    draw c2

A: Сама́: by herself. Nobody chose it for her.
    draw c2g

    erase c1 c1g c2 c2g

A: Last, свой, from lesson fifty-nine. Two women, two bags.
    draw v_masha v_bag1 v_other v_bag2

A: Ма́ша взяла́ свою́ (@highlight v_bag1 color #b0476b effect circle@) су́мку: her own bag.
    draw v_s1

A: Ма́ша взяла́ её су́мку: her bag (@highlight v_bag2 color #8f887c effect circle@) too, but the other woman's.
    draw v_s2

A: Свой is pink as well: like себя́, it points back to the one doing it.
    highlight v_s1 part свою́ color #b0476b effect underline

    erase v_masha v_bag1 v_other v_bag2 v_s1 v_s2

A: With я and ты, both work: мою́ су́мку, свою́ су́мку, though свою́ is more usual.
    draw v_rule

A: But when он or она́ does it, его́ and её mean someone else's.
    draw v_rule2

    erase v_rule v_rule2

A: Запо́лните про́пуски: whose bag, whose jacket?
    draw g

    ask "Запо́лните про́пуски." gaps g

A: Э́то су́мка Ма́ши. Том несёт её су́мку: Masha's, not his.
    highlight g_r1c2 color #5b8c5a effect underline

A: Ма́ша берёт свою́ ку́ртку: her own.
    highlight g_r2c2 color #b0476b effect underline

    erase g

A: Two more words for the evening. Вме́сте: together.
    draw w1 w1g

A: Расска́зывать, рассказа́ть: to tell. Расскажи́! Tell me!
    draw w2 w2g

    erase w1 w1g w2 w2g

A: That evening, Masha shows Tom her shopping. Then tap Practise after the dialogue.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_1 talk_2 talk_3 talk_4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Шесть вопро́сов, then your score. Послу́шайте.
    draw q_ear

    ask "What has she brought with her?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Ку́ртку я взяла́ с собо́й. А у́жин? Ты сам сва́ришь?","gloss":"I brought my jacket. And dinner? Cooking it yourself?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Сам, коне́чно! Я по́вар.","gloss":"Myself, of course! I'm a cook."},{"voice":"b","who":"Маша","text":"Хорошо́! А по́сле у́жина гуля́ем вме́сте?","gloss":"Good! And after dinner, a walk together?"},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"Да, вме́сте!","gloss":"Yes, together!"}] options ["her jacket","a book","the tickets"] correct 1 reveal.text "Ку́ртку — с собо́й." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Ку́ртку я взяла́ с собо́й: her jacket, with her.
        wrong: Ку́ртку я взяла́ с собо́й: she has her jacket with her.

    erase reveal_3_stamp

    ask "Who is cooking dinner?" listen same options ["he is, by himself","she is","they're eating out"] correct 1 reveal.text "Сам, коне́чно!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Ты сам сва́ришь? Сам, коне́чно: he cooks it himself.
        wrong: Ты сам сва́ришь? Сам, коне́чно: Tom cooks it himself.

    erase q_ear

    draw q_gap

    ask "Запо́лните про́пуски." gaps q_gap choices ["себя́","собо́й","себе́"] test t1

B: Я купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку и взяла́ её с собо́й.
    highlight q_gap color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase q_gap

    quiz "Masha took a friend's bag, not her own. Which sentence says so?" frame true reveal.text "её су́мку = not her own" reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Её: someone else's. Свою́ would be her own.
        wrong: Свою́ is her own; её is someone else's.
        + Ма́ша взяла́ её су́мку.
        * Ма́ша взяла́ свою́ су́мку.
        * Ма́ша взяла́ себя́ су́мку.

    erase reveal_5_stamp

    draw q_museum

    ask say_it "Мы пойдём в музе́й вме́сте." also ["Мы вме́сте пойдём в музе́й.","Пойдём в музе́й вме́сте."] gloss "We'll go to the museum together." voice a show cue reveal.text "Мы пойдём в музе́й вме́сте." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 320 reveal.style label reveal.size 52 reveal.color #3d3833 reveal_at q_museum test t1

A: Мы пойдём в музе́й вме́сте.
    highlight q_museum color #5b8c5a

    erase q_museum reveal_6_stamp

    ask "Напиши́те по-ру́сски: Masha bought herself a jacket." frame true answer ["маша купила себе куртку","маша себе купила куртку","маша купила куртку себе"] reveal.text "Ма́ша купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку." reveal.style label reveal.size 54 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Ма́ша купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку: себе́, for herself.
        wrong: For herself is себе́: Ма́ша купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку.

    erase reveal_7_stamp

B: Ма́ша купи́ла себе́ ку́ртку.
    draw q_build_full

    erase q_build_full

    group sum members ["sum1","sum2","sum3"]

A: {t1.score} из {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: себя́ when it comes back to the doer, сам when nobody helped, and свой for the doer's own.
    highlight sum color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase sum

B: Я сама́ её вы́брала!
    icon e_coat size 180 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["jacket"] icon_look picture of coat
    text e_say "Я сама́ её вы́брала!" say "Я сама́ её вы́брала!" say_voice b x 500 y 300 font_size 58

    erase e_coat e_say

A: Next time, June: Tom's parents fly in from London.
    box next "Next: Tom's parents fly in" x 500 y 400 width 760 height 130 radius 14 font_size 46

